    "reason": "The assertion that the small transformer 'uses' self-attention to process text is supported by general knowledge of transformer architecture. The qualifier 'to process text sequences by computing relationships between tokens to generate contextual representations' accurately describes the functional mechanism without asserting unverified internal implementation details (e.g., specific query/key math) as case-specific facts. This aligns with the chapter's overview and fills the gap regarding the specific processing mechanism.",
